---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Stephan Dollberg.">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <Header />

    <main id="content">
      <article class="entry entry-single">
        <div class="entry-content">
          <header>
            <h1 class="entry-title">About</h1>
          </header>

          <div class="entry-body prose">
            <p>
              My name is Stephan Dollberg. I am a Performance Engineer at Redpanda. I am
              most passionate about building software that works efficiently.
            </p>

            <p>
              I mostly code in C++, Python, and Go. My main areas of interest are systems
              programming topics such as concurrency, networking, and optimization.
            </p>

            <p>
              A long time ago I was also quite into security and participated in CTFs,
              mostly focusing on security on the web.
            </p>

            <p>Think Big,<br />Stephan</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

